# Docs map

Which doc to update for which kind of change. `/docs-update` and `/post-op` read this. Make targeted edits, never
rewrites, and update a README only in a folder the change touched. Delete the example row once you add real ones.

| Change | Update | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| New or changed API field | `docs/api/openapi.yaml` | Example only: field-level, with type and nullability |

Kinds to cover: API spec, help or support content, READMEs, planning or roadmap docs (reconciled against the ticket
system and the code), runbooks.
